description: >
  Grasshopper tools for additive manufacturing: tetrahedral meshing (TetGen, MMG3D),
  lattice generation, mesh booleans and simplification (Manifold), adaptive remeshing
  (MMGS), PDF layout export, and mesh/geometry utilities.

  Requires Rhino 8 or later. On Windows, Rhino must be running the .NET Core runtime:
  run the SetDotNetRuntime command, choose NETCore, and restart Rhino. Otherwise the
  plug-in will not load.
